      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 714537755,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1929245187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 730.25,
      "width": 452.4,
      "height": 373.75,
      "text": "request_id can never be a Prometheus label.\n\nPrometheus stores one time series per unique label\ncombination.  A label per request mints a permanent new\nseries every time, and a few thousand requests take the\nTSDB down.  That is the canonical anti-pattern.\n\nSo the labels are bounded on purpose:\n\n    service   method   route   status\n\nroute is the ROUTE RULE, never the path:\n\n    /documents/<doc_id>          one series\n    /documents/8979bc73-...      one series PER DOCUMENT\n\nHigh-cardinality identifiers live in the log LINE instead,\nwhere Loki parses them at query time and never indexes\nthem as labels:\n\n    {job=\"deeprunner\"} | json | request_id = \"r-f3219a89\"\n\nSame field, right pillar.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "request_id can never be a Prometheus label.\n\nPrometheus stores one time series per unique label\ncombination.  A label per request mints a permanent new\nseries every time, and a few thousand requests take the\nTSDB down.  That is the canonical anti-pattern.\n\nSo the labels are bounded on purpose:\n\n    service   method   route   status\n\nroute is the ROUTE RULE, never the path:\n\n    /documents/<doc_id>          one series\n    /documents/8979bc73-...      one series PER DOCUMENT\n\nHigh-cardinality identifiers live in the log LINE instead,\nwhere Loki parses them at query time and never indexes\nthem as labels:\n\n    {job=\"deeprunner\"} | json | request_id = \"r-f3219a89\"\n\nSame field, right pillar.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
